---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Industries We Serve"
  description="Proper Facilities Management serves multi-location restaurant and retail brands with facilities maintenance built around the demands of each industry."
  path="/industries"
>
  <section class="on-dark tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Industries</span>
      <h1 style="font-size:44px; max-width:700px;">Built around how your business runs</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:16px;">Restaurants and retail run on different clocks and different risks. The maintenance program should match.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="restaurants" class="on-white">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Restaurants</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:30px;">Keep the kitchen open and the dining room right</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:0;">
          A broken walk-in or a dark dining room doesn't just cost revenue — it costs guest trust and, sometimes, a health
          inspection. Proper covers the systems a restaurant can't operate without.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Nightly janitorial for dining rooms, restrooms, and back-of-house</li>
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Kitchen floor care, degreasing, and grease trap area cleanup</li>
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Kitchen equipment: hoods, grills, fryers, ovens</li>
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Walk-in coolers, reach-ins, and ice machines</li>
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Dining room HVAC, lighting, and plumbing</li>
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>After-hours emergency response before service the next day</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="retail" class="on-cream">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Retail</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:30px;">Keep every storefront on-brand and open</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:0;">
          Retail maintenance is a brand consistency problem as much as a facilities one. Proper keeps every location looking
          and functioning the way your standards require, wherever it sits on the map.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Recurring floor care for sales floors, fitting rooms, and stockrooms</li>
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Storefront window and glass cleaning</li>
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Storefront signage and lighting</li>
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>HVAC for sales floor and back-of-house</li>
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Doors, hardware, flooring, and fixture repair</li>
        <li><span class="check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Remodel and rollout turnover cleaning across multiple sites</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="on-dark tight">
    <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;">
      <h2 class="section-title">Not sure where your program fits?</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin:0 auto 20px;">Tell us about your locations and we'll put together a proposal scoped to your industry.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Request a proposal</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
